{"unit_id": "tag:023Q:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），见《概形上的拓扑（Topologies）》一章定义<REF_0001>。则<MATH_0002>在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中是普遍（universal）有效（effective）满态射（epimorphism），见《位点（Sites）》一章定义<REF_0002>。换言之，概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的每一个可表（representable）函子（functor）都满足 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）的层条件（sheaf condition），见《概形上的拓扑（Topologies）》一章定义<REF_0003>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc 覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "概形上的拓扑"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topology", "target_term": "fpqc 拓扑"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "概形上的拓扑"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "fpqc 覆盖", "context": "覆盖待决。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "概形上的拓扑", "context": "章名待决。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形术语待决。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "范畴待决。"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "普遍", "context": "普遍性待决。"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效", "context": "满态射有效性待决。"}, {"source_term": "epimorphism", "target_term": "满态射", "context": "满态射待决。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "位点", "context": "章名待决。"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表", "context": "可表性待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "函子待决。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc topolog